title={Simultaneous investigation of urinary and faecal glucocorticoid metabolite concentrations reveals short- versus long-term drivers of HPA-axis activity in a wild primate (Papio ursinus).},
authors={Christensen, Charlotte; Bracken, Anna M; Justin O'Riain, M; Heistermann, Michael; King, Andrew J;...},
