title={Ambient temperature, body condition and sibling rivalry explain feather corticosterone levels in developing black kites},
authors={López-Jiménez, Lidia; Blas, Julio; Tanferna, Alessandro; Cabezas, Sonia; Marchant, Tracy A.; Hira...},
