title={Investigating how telomere dynamics, growth and life history covary along an elevation gradient in two passerine species},
authors={Stier, Antoine; Delestrade, Anne; Bize, Pierre; Zahn, Sandrine; Criscuolo, François; Massemin, Sy...},
